ourse, the moment Lychee lets the scroll out of her hands, the prince finally appears. Only now it's Ranma's reluctant fiancee Akane Tendo that's holding the scroll, and the long-awaited prince is only too ready to sweep his lucky bride off her feet. Now Ranma and Co. have no choice but to follow Prince Kirin's majestic flying barge all the way to Nekonron, China, where they find themselves in a showdown with the Seven Lucky Gods of martial arts!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76932/2268691.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":418,"malId":418},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-28T07:48:11Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:418","mal:418"],"imdbSource":"anibridge-v3","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2850","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"2995","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"2996","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"367","scope":"R","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"anidb","id":"368","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"405","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"6141","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"6393","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1007"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1008"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1010"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1011"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10819"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10824"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10825"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"418","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5493"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6713"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"792"},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt0101583","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt0104604"},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt0109422"},{"provider":"mal","id":"1007"},{"provider":"mal","id":"1008"},{"provider":"mal","id":"1010"},{"provider":"mal","id":"1011"},{"provider":"mal","id":"10819"},{"provider":"mal","id":"10825"},{"provider":"mal","id":"418","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"5493"},{"provider":"mal","id":"6713"},{"provider":"mal